<body style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;text-align:center;margin-top:48px;color:#313131;">
  <p>Opening WhereTo (Dev)...</p>
  <p style="font-size:14px;color:#464B53;">If nothing happens, open the WhereTo (Dev) test app on this phone.</p>
  <script>
    // The same relay as /auth/callback/, for the Metro test app. That app has
    // its own app ID and link scheme (whereto-dev) so it installs next to the
    // store app, and a password reset asked for in it must open IT, not the
    // store app. App repo: APP_VARIANTS.md.
    window.location.replace('whereto-dev://auth/callback' + window.location.search + window.location.hash);
  </script>
</body>
